## Las interfaces SVI
!
!
interface Vlan2
  description **Servers II**   
  no shutdown
  vrf member OUTSIDE_TENANT
  ip address 192.168.2.1/24 tag 54321
  fabric forwarding mode anycast-gateway
!
interface Vlan10
  description **DB**  
  no shutdown
  vrf member OUTSIDE_TENANT
  ip address 192.168.10.1/24 tag 54321
  fabric forwarding mode anycast-gateway
!
interface Vlan23
  description LAN_ISILON 
  no shutdown
  vrf member OUTSIDE_TENANT
  ip address 10.220.23.1/24 tag 54321
  fabric forwarding mode anycast-gateway
!
interface Vlan100
  description **Managemeant Switchs**   
  vrf member OUTSIDE_TENANT
  ip address 192.168.100.1/24 tag 54321
  fabric forwarding mode anycast-gateway
!
interface Vlan101
  description **Managemeant Servers**   
  no shutdown
  vrf member OUTSIDE_TENANT
  no ip redirects
  ip address 192.168.101.1/24 tag 54321
  fabric forwarding mode anycast-gateway
!
interface Vlan500
  description **Servers I**   
  no shutdown
  vrf member OUTSIDE_TENANT
  no ip redirects
  ip address 192.168.1.1/24 tag 54321
  fabric forwarding mode anycast-gateway
!
interface Vlan660
  description INTERCONEXION_MPLS_MIAMI   
  no shutdown
  vrf member OUTSIDE_TENANT
  ip address 172.17.105.2/28 tag 54321
  fabric forwarding mode anycast-gateway
!
